Package: RosettaGBR
Title: Translation Between Methods for Measuring COTS and Coral Cover on the Great Barrier Reef
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("CCIP", "BR-04 Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "placeholder@example.com")
Description: Predicts one Great Barrier Reef monitoring measurement from
    another, with confidence and prediction intervals, through a single
    function, GBR_calibrate(). The tools covered are manta tow, ReefScan
    Surface, ReefScan Deep and eDNA, for coral cover (Beta regression) and
    Crown-of-Thorns Starfish counts and presence (Negative Binomial and
    Binomial regression), at tow, cull-site and reef level. Extends
    'RosettaCOTS' (Foster, github.com/Scott-Foster/RosettaCOTS), which
    supports the site-level calibration models of CCIP D-02, with the
    multi-level models built for CCIP BR-04 (project RJFMP). The fitted
    posterior draws are bundled with the package; it does not fit models.
